 {'id':'errors','title':'09 · Troubleshoot and finish','steps':['A live Meta outage is fail closed for payments. Mock mode is labeled and uses deterministic heuristics. SAM never fabricates substitute results.','If your session expires, sign in again. A missing invoice may belong to a different account or the old local SQLite database.','Live extraction, SAM and Muse chat use credits. Upload without Muse and browse Help steps for local behavior.','Sign out using the sidebar arrow when finished. No real money has moved.']},
 {'id':'council','title':'10 · Optional Muse review council','steps':['Select a pending invoice and click Require & run Muse council. This explicitly enables an extra simulation gate and uses three live model calls.','Audit, Policy and Forensic reviewers use separate contexts. Forensics receives a document preview when available. All three must return completed low-risk assessments; disagreement or unavailability holds the simulation.','The signed report is bound to the exact invoice evidence and expires after five minutes. Changed recipient, amount, content or document geometry invalidates it.','Use the separate Review exact simulation flow afterward. Deterministic controls and human approval still apply. Return to standard review explicitly removes only the optional council requirement.','Budget limits: one run per account/minute, three per account/hour, ten globally/hour. Failures count. Same-model errors can be correlated; signatures establish integrity, not correctness.']},
